7.mp3"},{"text":"Where does he work?","file":"audio/library/f5c5ddfabe5e36fc108fd5bb4c4255ff4c0de643a14bbfc79ab17984bc8413be.mp3"},{"text":"He works at sea.","file":"audio/library/a3fc9962acc25aa50c303704a4ddb5f15c30e39eeb849b44871f144aeb173479.mp3"},{"text":"How does he go to work?","file":"audio/library/de95a447a08e5fcd758d06f2d7a3c0e7aa6c6da60bc4393568364923d55f1444.mp3"},{"text":"He goes to work by bike.","file":"audio/library/51ade88c6ceeee04910fdacfd23643b5c905c04b9397ac24ed4c3885add20c0a.mp3"},{"text":"Where is the museum shop?","file":"audio/library/ebc4781511b81c1f4d28bd30729422ee77eb2895bda764404d71ec4478bf3fdb.mp3"},{"text":"It's near the door.","file":"audio/library/724334287a7b43fa14bdabf83564819326d3c667951201ebc28a108d26b82ee8.mp3"},{"text":"How can we get there?","file":"audio/library/a30535bfab35887e9fd5a57b428200acf8121b4c47fa69814c6bf4b897f351c6.mp3"},{"text":"Turn left at the bookstore.","file":"audio/library/b7dbc42bbbf9eb05137f58fbc1f77b2b9d3319d92726e248edb81245bf60d614.mp3"},{"text":"How do you come to school?","file":"audio/library/03f73ab7584daddce3135e1ef17b3a9be8323d291b60a922fe02aae4a212f893.mp3"},{"text":"Usually, I come on foot.","file":"audio/library/fa52106ba0203d2cd76d670875fe4ada67e6e16ee266d4cbf27f7c63061ca672.mp3"},{"text":"In the USA people on bikes must wear one.","file":"audio/library/bbc7fb324db0d13142fda0b1e45dc8ce896c3fab70a7bd77ec9c6d6bf919bd6b.mp3"},{"text":"Don't go at the red light!","file":"audio/library/d8b460f985ca58efd315f4e354fc05948f49eb9b606e5bf903f5b9b2e445668f.mp3"},{"text":"I must pay attention to the traffic lights!","file":"audio/library/7b287f363a813f04c2f8565784058c053ca4a995c3095a34b3e6f441ec17db46.mp3"},{"text":"What are you going to do tomorrow?","file":"audio/library/531aeafbf3223b4e4f2b8e8f7099caa0c1adc107298226790bfc32a472d948d0.mp3"},{"text":"I'm going to have an art lesson.","file":"audio/library/54568e000b47283eb9ab49c30374c0b6e29c81654b03ce42a019c9a9f86c6ec4.mp3"},{"text":"We're going to draw some pictures in Renmin Park.","file":"audio/library/7b25daccf79926c39adab65d85e1b2acc5d3cd7025750fb3b1ba815dd56273b5.mp3"},{"text":"Where are you going?","file":"audio/library/3e7c2a181fc1b0dee709ca1f8bfa780bdbe5c24585f73497fb2f953cf2bc801a.mp3"},{"text":"We're going to the cinema.","file":"audio/library/0d3cd5f3ce29d0ebe4c1861492e8960e4f43b768eeae137d315d30de7feffc9f.mp3"},{"text":"When are you going?","file":"audio/library/763c6aa24ae227a8fcac290bfd002abacfc91264076db35b06e221fae6d0ba1d.mp3"},{"text":"What are Peter's hobbies?","file":"audio/library/e8f3f06633dc0d097056ded4c513d3de9d23ee96d2aa3151e54376bd54ccd3e0.mp3"},{"text":"He likes reading stories.","file":"audio/library/0f8ca04d77dbf8f91fd2f00d853d86e39f2956995bc4a9e9de05a7d243108ce7.mp3"},{"text":"Does he live in Sydney?","file":"audio/library/b4a9c919080a600177aebc43482daa79cf4c0adccd3ef32b1783663d093f668f.mp3"},{"text":"No, he doesn't.","file":"audio/library/b9b3eb9153c6fb13c37eb8a321df0d7d5e23e6ba4c411029635c5e509251c1a8.mp3"},{"text":"Does he like doing word puzzles and going hiking?","file":"audio/library/5cf086ed74a606ff3fc722480650f633124505d44217591b792e6a474df8725e.mp3"},{"text":"Yes, he does.","file":"audio/library/50c9106716cd9563f23452ae4d8e8949399cf6cd02ac6391742235ed4007a157.mp3"},{"text":"What does he do? They're afraid of him.","file":"audio/library/4deb6df8b031d272c9be9fec6f5886de4587c81835a0725dc38789b147bffa75.mp3"},{"text":"He's a businessman. The cat is angry with them.","file":"audio/library/087e9d729a4c49535cad9904d80658fc0588ac0259193ccfeaed0cf972702776.mp3"},{"text":"Where does he work? What's wrong?","file":"audio/library/482e078d5168f9bd39bed5576d2b8793e824b5ffb4fa39fb6b2618a69c1dd7fc.mp3"},{"text":"He works at sea. Your father is ill.","file":"audio/library/31354cd6f951baa1b529f1808dd0d1902c49ac5254aa62c7cb6e5f38ffcdc816.mp3"},{"text":"How does he go to work? He should see a doctor this","file":"audio/library/e0416bbd4bbb6f7372f9d2c4e48318b6b29c21023638495ee138010dc2662370.mp3"},{"